something childish / lavatoriously humorous. Five centiLindars =
Chuckling out loud at something when it isn't appropriate (i.e. "I'll
be working under you for the duration of this project."). One Lindar =
Doing something completely socially inappropriate. One and a half lds.
= Being offensive enough to get in trouble and / or get reprimanded.
